# Catalog Content Rules

- Write benefits-first copy: explain value before technical details.
- Keep product/service names concise and unique.
- Display price or pricing model near the main CTA.
- Show trust markers close to conversion points (reviews, guarantees, terms).
- Use clear stock/availability/service-status labels.
- Keep filter labels user-facing (not internal naming).
- For each card, define one primary CTA and optional secondary action.

## Conversion Requirements

- Every page has a clear primary next step.
- Avoid dead-end sections without links or actions.
- Keep legal and delivery/payment details easy to find.
